      "content": "Containerizing Node.js + Express with health-check probes on port 3000 ensures continuous uptime. Combined with MongoDB replicaset and Socket.io redis adapter, you get effortless horizontal scaling! 🌐",
      "mediaUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80",
